msgid ""
"How to use the \"auth\" command to sign a Pixhawk Board with your "
"Certificate of Authenticity"
msgstr "如何使用「auth」命令为 Pixhawk 板卡签发真品证书"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:8
#: 8bb6175b55354d1995ca879eef21e744
msgid ""
"``ARCHIVED: this topic is archived. It's out of date and no longer works``"
msgstr "``已归档：本主题已归档，内容已过时且不再适用``"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:11
#: 0b645e5ffa024777ba92f7eafd9fbc23
msgid ""
"The essence of this process is an RSA private/public key pair and a signing "
"process that uses these keys to put some unique information onto every "
"Pixhawk board."
msgstr "该流程的核心是一对 RSA 私钥/公钥，以及使用这对密钥将唯一信息写入每块 Pixhawk 板卡的签名过程。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:16
#: 5c12fd56f1e440f8bb8304c209bde272
msgid "Public/Private Key/s, SD Card, and Logging"
msgstr "公钥/私钥、SD 卡与日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:18
#: 944b7bbded444b4ba99c918fc78cd9d7
msgid "The \"auth\" command will"
msgstr "「auth」命令将会"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:20
#: 5ad41b38df564ca6a495084373980a4f
msgid "read a properly prepared public/private key data from the SD card"
msgstr "从SD卡读取已正确准备好的公钥/私钥数据"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:21
#: 7c39ce0dc3c64ce787d15e8b1bdb7367
msgid ""
"use the key off the SD card to create the Certificate-Of-Authenticity (COA) "
"in the One-Time_programmable (OTP) ROM."
msgstr "使用SD卡中的密钥在一次性可编程（OTP）ROM中创建真实性证书（COA）。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:23
#: 246db147dd7a4a529b8704e9353a2fa2
msgid ""
"log the results to a log file on the SD card, for your records. (optional)"
msgstr "将结果记录到SD卡上的日志文件中，供存档使用。（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:27
#: 3edb04c4d906480d925c3b46005fac41
msgid "Bootloader"
msgstr "引导加载程序"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:29
#: df4afd0160304e3a80b33d9b19876021
msgid ""
"The bootloader must identify itself as revision 4 or  later for this to "
"work."
msgstr "引导加载程序必须标识为第4修订版或更新版本，该功能才能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:32
#: be06750123ca4dfa80380e4ec0d52274
msgid ""
"eg: px_uploader.py should say something like: \"Found board xxxx bootloader "
"rev 4 on /xxxxxxx \""
msgstr ""
"例如：px_uploader.py 应输出类似以下内容：「Found board xxxx bootloader rev 4 on /xxxxxxx」"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:36
#: c5140dc2f79f4fdcab81b9771bdded95
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:38
#: 93e7106e0cfb475c98281c1a4de1e18b
msgid ""
"The firmware must contain a directory Firmware/src/systemcmds/auth and have "
"a recent \"auth.c\"."
msgstr "固件必须包含 Firmware/src/systemcmds/auth 目录，并具有最新版本的「auth.c」文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:41
#: 9bb998e2ba18469d960d92d5a428c2f6
msgid ""
"typically made and uploaded with \"make px4fmu-v1_auth upload\", or similar."
msgstr "通常使用「make px4fmu-v1_auth upload」或类似命令进行构建和上传。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:43
#: 723f8898d97949be8ebd4ddbc1121741
msgid ""
"verify you have a suitable version of the firmware loaded on your PX4 by "
"connecting to the nsh in the usual way, and typing 'auth'[enter]"
msgstr "通过常规方式连接到 nsh，然后输入「auth」并回车，以验证您的 PX4 上已加载合适版本的固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:45
#: 0ba01928235d41e68ed572a9beace44b
msgid ""
"the \"auth\" command can do a bunch of stuff related to "
"reading/writing/verifying/signing/logging of OTP data.    It's the main tool"
" you'll use ( see below).  It can read/write public/private key data from SD"
" card, or it can use a \"hardcoded\" TEST version."
msgstr ""
"「auth」命令可以执行与OTP数据的读取/写入/验证/签名/日志记录相关的多项操作。它是您将使用的主要工具（详见下文）。它可以从SD卡读取/写入公钥/私钥数据，也可以使用「硬编码」的测试版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:51
#: 71ed3421f28b42ea9721d7ae2855b2b1
msgid "Preparing SD card (one time only)"
msgstr "准备SD卡（仅需一次）"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:53
#: cf6f9fa5919f4a5baf27733c249c4bda
msgid ""
"Using a tool on linux or OSX called *ssh-keygen* make a new \"pair\" of "
"1024bit RSA keyfiles like this:"
msgstr "在 Linux 或 OSX 上使用名为 *ssh-keygen* 的工具，按如下方式生成一对新的 1024 位 RSA 密钥文件："

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:60
#: 1a6c2dd4c9404b1ba41c67ca870eef7b
msgid "Generating public/private rsa key pair."
msgstr "正在生成公钥/私钥 RSA 密钥对。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:61
#: 2c277a29947d4ecda90572b36ef06c4a
msgid "Enter passphrase (empty for no passphrase):  [just press enter]"
msgstr "输入密码短语（留空则无密码）：[直接按回车]"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:62
#: 8b6fc93267a14ee4b42fb91ff8c7187b
msgid "Enter same passphrase again: [just press enter, again]"
msgstr "再次输入相同的密码短语：[再次直接按回车]"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:67
#: 12fd7d570774432d8b9baff426f5cd56
msgid "This is"
msgstr "这是"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:67
#: 52ec6441dc624c2db1508a5c310a5b0c
msgid ""
"your *PRIVATE* key  - do not share this file.  back it up and keep it safe."
msgstr "您的 *私钥* —— 请勿共享此文件。请备份并妥善保管。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:72
#: e18109fb160e449c82cb11c5ea121202
msgid "This is your"
msgstr "这是您的"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:73
#: 8305ea36fab44b99847a88adbb7c837b
msgid "*PUBLIC* key  - share it with all GCS makers, etc."
msgstr "*公钥* —— 可与所有地面控制站（GCS）开发者等共享。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:75
#: cc30d61bff50442ab585d491d7d14ee4
msgid "Format the private key file to suit the PX4:"
msgstr "将私钥文件格式化以适配 PX4："

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:76
#: 7bdfe64b67ab464b9e84f3162bec4b82
msgid "Copy the rsa1024 to a new file, called \"privatekey.txt\""
msgstr "将 rsa1024 复制到名为「privatekey.txt」的新文件中"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:77
#: 843be6be482a48628cb3ad98fc19015b
msgid ""
"Edit the file with a text editor to remove the first and last lines of the "
"file (they say ``-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----`` and ``-----END RSA "
"PRIVATE KEY-----``) and save it."
msgstr ""
"使用文本编辑器编辑该文件，删除文件的第一行和最后一行（内容为 ``-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----`` 和 "
"``-----END RSA PRIVATE KEY-----``），然后保存文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:80
#: 63c12b2dbb4d46f8af1542a4bfcb390e
msgid ""
"Copy the **privatekey.txt** to a SD card which you will insert into a PX4 "
"that is setup as per above.  Do not use this method for the public key.  See"
" below."
msgstr "将 **privatekey.txt** 复制到SD卡上，然后将该SD卡插入按上述方式配置好的 PX4。公钥请勿使用此方式处理。详见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:83
#: 7724b115401b48b9939786bb5050dc72
msgid "Make the public key file on the SD card:"
msgstr "在SD卡上创建公钥文件："

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:85
#: c0461ae2bdab45c88b2ff5733c56ed10
msgid ""
"With the SD card inserted, and the Pixhawk booted, use the *nsh shell*, and "
"type:"
msgstr "插入SD卡并启动 Pixhawk 后，使用 *nsh shell* 输入："

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:92
#: 97c1a44eff874a0485dc3cd23d3b954d
msgid ""
"this will use the **privatekey.txt** on the SD card, and create a "
"**publickey.txt** on the SD card (this file is needed for many of the auth "
"commands to work)."
msgstr ""
"这将使用SD卡上的 **privatekey.txt**，并在SD卡上创建 **publickey.txt**（许多 auth "
"命令正常工作都需要此文件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:97
#: ff4b087a5929425cbc40224e89622f6a
msgid "Validate it works"
msgstr "验证其是否正常工作"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:99
#: 31ca0a3bb980423f9e2815d43ffe20d8
msgid ""
"There are lots of options to the \"auth\" command that you can use to test "
"your configuration."
msgstr "「auth」命令有很多选项，可用于测试您的配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:104
#: 6a2ea138473f423383b7ba69f9c5717c
msgid ""
"The only really \\*hazardous\\* options are ``-w`` and ``-k``. Avoid these "
"till you are sure everything else seems to be going well."
msgstr "真正具有 \\*风险\\* 的选项只有 ``-w`` 和 ``-k``。在确认其他一切正常之前，请避免使用这两个选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:107
#: 50870ec359934e04ad454d1f1a828e3c
msgid ""
"It is a good idea to reboot each time you use the 'auth' command, as it's "
"very aggressive on RAM usage."
msgstr "每次使用「auth」命令后最好重启，因为该命令对 RAM 的占用非常大。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:109
#: 41b6814c188240988ee74d95e50f1c5c
msgid ""
"When you are sure you have everything OK, run ``auth -k -l``  (it will write"
" a new COA to OTP, and lock it) and optionally ``auth -v`` to verify it "
"worked."
msgstr ""
"当您确认一切正常后，运行 ``auth -k -l``（将向OTP写入新的COA并锁定），可选择性地运行 ``auth -v`` 以验证操作是否成功。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:114
#: 7436c80e69a6417080558508ef266a34
msgid "Automate running the 'auth' script  from the SD card"
msgstr "自动从SD卡运行「auth」脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:116
#: 534acbcd01a54f1899c25f3bc38c27b6
msgid "Make an \"etc\" folder on the SD card if one is not already there."
msgstr "如果SD卡上尚无「etc」文件夹，请创建一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:117
#: fb6b3153f4334854a770e36604c24314
msgid ""
"Make a rc, or **rc.txt** file ( either works ) on the SD card, in the */etc*"
" folder if one is not already there."
msgstr "如果SD卡上的 */etc* 文件夹中尚无 rc 或 **rc.txt** 文件（两者均可），请创建一个。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:119
#: 217364ec11064fa7b3f91ba663bc2f41
msgid ""
"Edit the **rc.txt** file, and put the ``auth -k -l`` command in the file as "
"you wish it to be run."
msgstr "编辑 **rc.txt** 文件，按需将 ``auth -k -l`` 命令写入文件中。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-to-use-the-auth-command-to-sign-a-pixhawk-board-with-your-certificate-of-authenticity.rst:121
#: 71124bdb695244d490e1a95d9ab235c0
msgid ""
"(When booted with this card inserted it will make the PX4 flash the OTP area"
" with the COA and log the results to **OTPCertificates.log**)"
msgstr "（插入该SD卡启动时，PX4 将把COA写入OTP区域，并将结果记录到 **OTPCertificates.log** 中）"
